---
/** Rendered on any route the Part 6A gate has not authorised. The page exists so
 *  it can be reviewed and flipped in one CSV edit; it is noindex and unlinked
 *  until then, and this notice makes that state visible to anyone previewing.
 *
 *  The trailing sentence used to say "until the evidence is on record", which
 *  became wrong for the five county hubs whose evidence IS on record and which
 *  are held back on page quality instead. It states the mechanism now, and the
 *  reason prop states the cause. */
const { reason } = Astro.props;
---
<p class="notice"><strong>Not published.</strong> {reason} It is excluded from every sitemap, linked from nowhere, and carries noindex until that changes.</p>
